WEBVTT

00:02:58.282 --> 00:03:01.971
ikawa teule kwa wachache.

00:03:01.971 --> 00:03:05.940
Pili, tamaduni.

00:03:05.940 --> 00:03:08.882
wanafunzi waliohitimu elimu ya juu,

00:03:08.882 --> 00:03:12.970
wanaojimudu, wanataka masomo, hawawezi

00:03:12.970 --> 00:03:16.266
Kwa sababu haiheshimiki,

00:03:16.266 --> 00:03:18.670
si mahali pa mwanamke.

00:03:18.670 --> 00:03:21.234
Hii ndio taswira ya mamia ya wanawake

00:03:21.234 --> 00:03:23.010
Afrika, Kwa mfano,

00:03:23.010 --> 00:03:25.120
Waliozuiliwa kwa elimu ya juu

00:03:25.120 --> 00:03:27.722
kwa sababu ya kinga za tamaduni.

00:03:27.722 --> 00:03:30.110
Na hapa ni sababu ya tatu: